rather than the IMU sensor library. Flutter pointer events provide touch positions in logical pixels and
timestamps relative to an arbitrary event-dispatch timeline [40-42]. Therefore, IMU-specific filtering and
gravity removal were not applied to PinchToSize data. Instead, seven touchscreen-derived time-series features
were standardised before model input: timestamp, diameter, dist_to_target, dist_to_target_pct, expansion_rate,
