gait, and touchscreen fine-motor domains, while also showing that the preferred ensemble configuration
depends on the selected performance metric. Development-set out-of-fold complete-case counts are reported
in Supplementary Table S2, full ensemble held-out ROC curves are provided in Supplementary Figures S6
