Public-Dataset Task-Domain Benchmarking
Public-dataset ROC AUC estimates ranged from 0.7333 to 0.9000, indicating that the task-specific Conv1D
BiLSTM workflow produced discrimination across related public sensor-task domains. PADS tremor-domain
results were close to the corresponding CheckPD internal reference results, with ROC AUC 0.8417 versus
